  "title": "Grandma Winnie&#39;s Turkey Stuffing",
  "description": "This recipe for bread stuffing calls for canned mushrooms, onion, celery, and poultry seasoning. It will make enough to stuff a 12 to 15 pound turkey.",
  "authors": [
